{"articleNo":"1599","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1599&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"해외(중국)취업 연수생 추가 모집 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.02.10","hit":"10379","attachments":[{"name":"참가 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1599&attachNo=69760"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><font size=\"3\">&nbsp; </font>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"635\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" height=\"81\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">해외(중국)취업 『산업경영 직무 전문가』</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">연수과정 추가모집 안내</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p><font size=\"3\"></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">1. 개&nbsp;&nbsp; 요</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"> 사업 목적 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 15.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">1) 한국내 대학 졸업자(전문대 포함) 및 미취업자 중 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">우수한 인재 선발</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -15pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">2) 맞춤형 “인사, 마케팅, 생산 및 품질관리교육”과 이에 따른 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">“직무관련언어(중국어) 교육”을 집중 심화 학습</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">하여 현장관리에 필요한 인재 육성</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 53.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">3) 내실 있는 해외기업에 취업하여 연수생의 역량을 발휘, 회사의 발전에 기여 할 수 있는 기회 제공</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 53.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">4) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><strong>기존의 연수비만 국가에서 지원하는 해외취업과 달리 연수비용 외에 현지 체재비(180만원)와 취업 성과금(120만원) 추가 지원으로 연수생&nbsp; 실부담금 없음.(선지급 후환급) - [추가지원 해당자는 아래에 명시]</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">2. 세부일정</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 260%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 260%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 연수일정 : ‘11. 3월 ~ 7월 / 5개월(국내 4개월, 국외 1개월) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수일정 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">’11년 3월 14일까지 참가신청서 작성 후 접수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;e-mail : </span><a href=\"mailto:choidh@kumoh.ac.kr\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">choidh@kumoh.ac.kr</span></a></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">홈페이지 : </span></font><a href=\"http://hrd.kumoh.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">http://hrd.kumoh.ac.kr/</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"> -&gt;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">수강신청란에 접</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">수</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.8pt\">방문 및 우편접수 : 금오공과대학교 공동실험실습관 313호<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;HRD센터 최동호 팀</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;문의전화 : 054) 478-7924, 7921</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 260%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 260%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 연수인원 : 20명 선착순 모집 / 면접 후 연수생 선정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 73.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 110%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 연수대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 73.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 해외취업을 희망하는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 연령이 만 28세 이하인 미취업자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(단, 28세 이상은 관련 직무 경력이 3년 이상인 자)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">공단으로부터 지원받은 해외취업 연수과정(인턴포함)의 수강사실이 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">없거나, </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1회 이상 수강 하지 아니한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 2년제 이공계열 대학졸업자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 4년제 대학 이상 졸업(예정)자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6) 교육 수료 전 졸업이 가능한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 270%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 270%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7) 해외여행 및 중국취업비자 발급에 결격사유가 없는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 연수비 : 연수비용 국비(한국산업인력공단) 지원,&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;개인부담금(230만원),<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [국내․외 연수비, 항공료, 비자발급, 중국 현지 숙식비용 등 포함]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 체재비 지원 : 1) 중국현지 연수 시(6월말)&nbsp; 경북도청에서&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;체제비 180만원 개인별 지급</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 현지 취업 시 경북도청에서 취업 성과금<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 120만원 개인별 지급<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 단, 체재비와 성과금은 경북지역 거주 주민만 해당<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(자세한 사항 및 지급가능자격은 문의바랍니다.)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp; 사. 환불규정 : 중도탈락 및 중도 포기시 개인부담금의 환불규정(일할계산)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[개인부담금&nbsp;* (1- (지난 연수일/총 연수일))]<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ex) 총 연수일이 150일 중 30일이 지났을 경우,<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [230만원 * (1-(30/150)] = 184만원 환불<br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;아. 연수내용 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">산업경영 직무 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">전문가 양성</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">과정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 중국어 교육 : 기초 회화, 실무회화, 비즈니스 회화</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 직무교육 : 경영학/품질/마케팅/유통/인사/재무, 전산사무 교육 외</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 교양 교육 : 직장예절, 자기관리, 시간관리, 리더십 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -37.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 문화 교육 : 중국 문화 및 생활환경, 중국 직장 생활에 관한 사항 등</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp; 자. 취업조건 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">기업의 요구에 따라 중국내 기업에 즉시 채용 및 일정기간(6개월 내외) 수습채용 후 현지채용 여부확정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 73.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 취업애로 청년층 해외취업 지원사업 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 24.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 내용 : 한국산업인력공단에서 글로벌 인재육성 및 해외취업 활성화를 위해 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 24.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 경제적 부담으로 인해 해외취업에 소외되었던 취업애로 청년층에게 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 24.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 해외취업 소요비용을 지원함.(차상위 계층)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 24.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 24.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 24.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&lt;중국취업에 관심 있고, 진취적인 분들의 많은 참여를 바랍니다&gt;</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 24.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font>